{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_title", "source_sha256": "d88791568cf90d548eecc5219990d26ce448b1c1399d7209d60a0a810ba51f5b", "ja": "瑞希とおでかけ2", "zh": "和瑞希外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5158b5786a7fe835a5dd7087df32f7eabc2a5414bd40b6a9a1e955281554a6bf", "ja": "瑞希とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和瑞希一同外出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "32ac9b6f204689e0ea77829d2e3ba5dfbb62cca25001e78448f6243c52ec7178", "ja": "（見渡す限りの雪景色。なんだか今日はいつもと\n違って清々しいな。おや、あそこにいるのは……）", "zh": "（放眼望去尽是雪景。总觉得今天格外神清气爽。咦，那里的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "bca8285e4dbe913d054cced3940a958fb6cf0c39887868010953d654cf4fe90f", "ja": "{$P$}。\nおはようございます。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n早上好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "be43141daefac386fd52a93e27212e925436da6a0024e007634d8bfacb5dd23e", "ja": "おはよう。瑞希、どうかしたのか？\n山の方をじっと見つめていたけど……。", "zh": "早上好。瑞希，怎么了？\n刚才一直盯着山那边看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "3e7fc756bc7dbc372f1898d889de4fa785cff22e9d1ceb8dab81ae75c300e478", "ja": "はい。地平線が見えるのを確かめていました。\n今日は天気がいいので。", "zh": "是的。我是在确认能看到地平线。\n因为今天天气很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "73a67d7ee3b06b86629f7384d445c77b8311880df1e0d6c3130cd5607611677c", "ja": "秋田は曇りがおおくて、空も白いことが多く……\n雪と相まって、まさに真っ白な世界。", "zh": "秋田经常是阴天，天空也总是白茫茫的……再加上白雪，简直就是一片纯白的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "781f7a1de04675e69cbfee24eb9f5c51944b395770ceed451d5b4a265ef2a1c0", "ja": "でも、今日は珍しく晴れているので、\n山の稜線までくっきり。……きれいだぞ。", "zh": "不过，今天难得是个晴天，连山的轮廓都清晰可见。……真漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "95cffd082fd2009950f7703a17bf8d817526310b570fd35739276359c1b37c8d", "ja": "おお、本当だ……。気がつかなかったよ。\n瑞希はよく見てるな。", "zh": "哦，真的……我都没注意到。\n瑞希，你观察得真仔细。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "9592cd1537248a7e32a310732043a57827dce331ada5744ed8ba2f9c91944d43", "ja": "曇天は、心が落ち着くので好きですが。\n……こうして見る晴天も、いいものですね。", "zh": "阴天让人心情平静，所以我喜欢。\n……不过这样看着晴天，也别有一番滋味呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0218_story_044miz02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_044miz02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4f98a98816adf839b082a4e75fd3bc3d4f0e8ba982e19ae932ffa74a187c5cdd", "ja": "（瑞希としばらく山々の風景を眺めた。\n澄んだ空気の中、心地よい時間を過ごせたな……）", "zh": "（和瑞希一起眺望了一会儿山峦的景色。\n在清新的空气中，度过了一段舒适的时光……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
